    "body": "I think leaking app presence even if the user clicks the link might be an issue. Now any website can bait the user into clicking some link inside an iframe, check if it starts navigating away or not, and then know if they have the app installed.\nIt should be possible to hide the existence of the app from the page either way. (always opening the fallback as if it had `target=\"_blank\"` or `target=\"_top\"`)",
